      "writtenOn": "2023-05-11T23:24:49Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "While we may save the EC from WDT, we miss some other important events (e.g. usbc pd). So, I\u0027m not sure if it\u0027s ok to let the AP occupy the EC (and starve other tasks). There is EC_RES_BUSY. WDYT?",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 49,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 51,
        "endChar": 45
      },
      "revId": "f7c1c282e8e48f5c526ebc684b88850498eb8798",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "15bcd191_84048f18",
